Source: minios-store
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: crims0n <crims0n@minios.dev>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 11), gettext
Standards-Version: 4.1.3
Homepage: https://minios.dev

Package: minios-store-common
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.6),
         squashfs-tools
Description: MiniOS Store common library
 Shared Python library for the MiniOS Store backend components.
 Provides the installer engine, configuration, and logging modules
 used by both the WebSocket daemon and the GTK3 graphical installer.

Package: minios-store
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         minios-store-common (= ${binary:Version}),
         python3-websockets,
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         xdg-utils,
         lsb-base (>= 3.0-6)
Description: MiniOS Store WebSocket daemon
 WebSocket daemon for the MiniOS Store. Listens on ws://127.0.0.1:8765
 and handles installation requests from the web interface at
 store.minios.dev. Manages the creation and installation of squashfs
 modules.

Package: minios-store-gui
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         minios-store-common (= ${binary:Version}),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-3.0,
         polkitd | policykit-1,
         pkexec | policykit-1,
         xdg-utils
Description: MiniOS Store GTK3 graphical installer
 Standalone GTK3 graphical installer for the MiniOS Store. Handles
 minios-store:// URI scheme for installing applications directly from
 the browser without the WebSocket daemon running. Includes PolicyKit
 integration for privilege escalation.
